    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... there are no small steps. it's just the same wall every single time. i'm just so fucking exhausted by the effort of it all. what's even the point of trying to break a pattern that always just breaks me? it feels like the only way to actually stop the cycle is to just... not do it anymore. to just stop.",
